<title>UK: WestLB sets 1.0 bln mark October 2005 Pfandbrief.</title>
<headline>WestLB sets 1.0 bln mark October 2005 Pfandbrief.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Westdeutsche Landesbank, Bayerische Landesbank, Bankgesellschaft Berlin, Deutsche Girozentrale-Deutsche Kommunalbank and Landesbank Rheinland-Pfalz.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WESTDEUTSCHE LANDESBANK</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     5.25	MATURITY    14.OCT.05</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  96.715    PAY DATE  S-22.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  32.5 BP   LISTING    FFT	 S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) ONE	 MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC   22.5 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBREIF 7503</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
